+  <div class="mast"><div class="k">Outbound Studio · execution workflow · capability map</div><h1>Draft account-specific outbound messages.</h1><div class="fam">execution workflow (live execution) · settled 2026-07-04 (conversation-stage spine)</div><p>Outbound Studio generates drafts from supplied account, contact, outreach stage, trigger, and question inputs. Preserve channel routing, logging, and existing completeness scoring.</p><div class="src">Sourced from: canon §4.8 + the send-line generator (5 temperatures × 4 personas · shipped src/outbound-studio). Settled design: outbound-studio-CHOSEN-complete-2026-07-04.html.</div></div>
+  <div class="sec"><div class="sn">1 · Purpose</div><h2>What the room is for</h2><div class="sd">Generate only from supplied evidence. Do not invent buyer motives, customer proof, payback, attachments, or outcomes. State the reason for outreach and a clear next question; keep the no-ask option and stable internal stage keys.</div></div><div class="sec"><div class="sn">2 · What it offers</div><h2>The primitives</h2><table><tr><th style="width:230px">Capability / surface</th><th>What it does</th></tr><tr><td style="width:230px"><b>The operator rack inputs</b></td><td>account · buyer · persona · temperature · trigger — the 5 inputs that define the line.</td></tr><tr><td style="width:230px"><b>The route method sheet</b></td><td>Channel + asset + CTA chosen by temperature × persona.</td></tr><tr><td style="width:230px"><b>The no-ask mode toggle</b></td><td>Omits the CTA paragraph — give-first sends.</td></tr><tr><td style="width:230px"><b>The generated send line</b></td><td>The exact line, deterministic, with the trigger woven in.</td></tr><tr><td style="width:230px"><b>The angle save</b></td><td>Save a working angle (company + trigger + persona) — deduped.</td></tr><tr><td style="width:230px"><b>The touch log</b></td><td>Every send scoped to the account, with an inline outcome editor.</td></tr><tr><td style="width:230px"><b>Message completeness</b></td><td>Existing completeness thresholds: ready ≥80, workable ≥60, otherwise needs more detail. Review factual support before sending.</td></tr></table></div><div class="sec"><div class="sn">3 · Flows</div><h2>What comes in, what goes out</h2><div class="flows"><div class="flowcol inn"><div class="fh">Flows in</div><ul class="plain"><li>account + priority score from <b>Signal Console</b></li><li>personas from <b>ICP Studio</b></li><li>approaches from <b>Territory Architect</b></li></ul></div><div class="flowcol out"><div class="fh">Flows out</div><ul class="plain"><li>recorded activity → <b>Dashboard</b> · <b>LinkedIn Playbook</b> · <b>Readiness</b> · <b>sales handoff documentation</b></li></ul></div></div></div><div class="sec"><div class="sn">4 · Guardrails</div><h2>Must never be flattened · what it is NOT</h2><div class="two"><div><div class="sn" style="color:var(--red)">Must never be flattened</div><ul class="plain"><li>Specific, evidence-based messages and responsible outreach</li><li>No send path without a named strain</li><li>The recovery cable on every route</li></ul></div><div><div class="sn" style="color:var(--ink-3)">What it is NOT</div><ul class="plain"><li>Never a template-spam generator</li><li>Not a mail-merge tool</li><li>Not a sequence blaster</li><li>Not a generic copy generator</li></ul></div></div></div>
