in, no funnel jargon</h2><div class="sd">The shipped face leaned on jargon a first-timer can’t parse — all reworded. Optional room rename flagged for the founder: “Quota Workback” is mild jargon (“workback”); candidates: <i>Your Number / The Daily Number / Backing Into Your Number</i> — not changed yet.</div><table data-copy-context="deprecated-example"><tr><th style="width:230px">Banned on the face</th><th>Say instead</th></tr><tr><td>touches/day · opps/quarter · m2o</td><td>messages & calls a day · real opportunities · first meetings</td></tr><tr><td>“the meeting-creation floor”</td><td>name the plain thing</td></tr><tr><td>“quality score 71/100”</td><td>a plain judgment — “this plan is a stretch”</td></tr></table></div><div class="sec"><div class="sn">7 · Guardrails</div><h2>Must never be flattened · what it is NOT</h2><div class="two"><div><div class="sn" style="color:var(--red)">Must never be flattened</div><ul class="plain"><li>Quota translated into explicit activity and pipeline requirements</li><li>The daily habit as the one dominant state</li><li>The believability honesty (the optimistic assumption + its cost) — the room’s soul</li><li>Pipeline coverage as live reality, not a decorative meter</li></ul></div><div><div class="sn" style="color:var(--ink-3)">What it is NOT</div><ul class="plain"><li>Not disconnected planning math</li><li>Not a BI-dashboard card grid</li><li>Not a decorative meter</li><li>Not a spreadsheet</li></ul></div></div></div>
