+# Antaeus Language Remediation — Index and Phase Status
+
+Branch: `language-remediation-v1`
+
+## Governing target
+
+Reduce the rendered product-language saturation score from **93/100** to **20/100 or below**, using the unchanged nine-dimension rubric documented in `00_MASTER_PLAN_AND_METHODOLOGY.md`.
+
+## Source method
+
+Language decisions are made against the full rendered preview corpus generated by `tools/preview/build-transcript.js` and represented under `preview-transcript/`. Repository source is then traced and changed at the highest correct implementation point. Generated transcript output is never patched as the implementation.
+
+See `01_SOURCE_METHODOLOGY.md`.
+
+## Canonical remediation artifacts
+
+1. `00_MASTER_PLAN_AND_METHODOLOGY.md` — complete plan, logic, language rules, phases, acceptance criteria.
+2. `01_SOURCE_METHODOLOGY.md` — why the rendered walkthrough is the language-analysis corpus and how repo source is used afterward.
+3. `02_LANGUAGE_MIGRATION_MAP.md` — private-ontology and semantic migration map.
+4. `03_INTERNAL_LANGUAGE_DOCTRINE_REWRITE.md` — internal-language standard that prevents the old dialect from regenerating.
+5. `04_REWRITE_BATCH_01_SHARED_AND_CORE.md` — shared chrome, Welcome, Dashboard, Readiness, ICP Studio, Future Autopsy.
+6. `05_REWRITE_BATCH_02_STRATEGIC_AND_DIAGNOSTIC.md` — Territory, Signal Console, Briefing, Getting to Signed, Pilot, Founding GTM, Call in a Favor.
+7. `06_REWRITE_BATCH_03_EXECUTION_AND_UTILITY.md` — Prospecting, Events, Outbound, Cold Call, LinkedIn, Discovery, Deal Workspace, Quota, Settings.
+8. `07_AI_PROMPT_AND_GENERATOR_REWRITE_SPEC.md` — generated-language rules.
+9. `08_COPY_LINTER_AND_CI_SPEC.md` — regression-control specification.
+10. `09_IMPLEMENTATION_ORDER_FOR_CODING_AGENT.md` — source-tracing and implementation sequence.
+11. `10_HIGH_SEVERITY_INTERACTION_PATCH.md` — interaction-state language decisions beyond room-at-rest copy.
+12. `11_REMAINING_CONTEXTUAL_GENERATOR_REVIEW.md` — cases that must be fixed at generator/template level rather than by literal replacement.
+
+## Phase status
+
+| Phase | Status | Notes |
+|---|---|---|
+| 1 · Corpus + methodology | Complete | 5,627 rendered occurrences; 2,780 unique strings analyzed. |
+| 2 · Shared semantic architecture decisions | Complete | Ground, Live Edge, readiness, heat/account-priority, motion, recommendation language decided. |
+| 3 · Highest-saturation room rewrites | Complete as language decisions | Source implementation in progress. |
+| 4 · Strategic/diagnostic room rewrites | Complete as language decisions | Source implementation pending. |
+| 5 · Execution/utility room rewrites | Complete as language decisions | Source implementation pending. |
+| 6 · Generated-language/internal-doctrine specs | Complete | Source implementation pending. |
+| 7 · Source tracing + implementation | **In progress** | Start with shared components and generators. |
+| 8 · Copy linter + CI | Pending | Implement after initial source migration. |
+| 9 · Regenerate walkthrough + re-score | Pending | Same corpus generator and same scoring rubric. |
+
+## Implementation rule
+
+Do not let a coding agent independently rewrite the product. The language decisions in this directory are the approved semantic source. The coding task is to locate the source that produces the rendered language, implement the approved decision, preserve behavior/data semantics, and validate the regenerated product.
