patterns.</td></tr><tr><td style="width:230px"><b>The toggleable views</b></td><td>Focus / Timeline / List — different views of the same deal-risk factors.</td></tr></table></div><div class="sec"><div class="sn">5 · Flows</div><h2>What comes in, what goes out</h2><div class="flows"><div class="flowcol inn"><div class="fh">Flows in</div><ul class="plain"><li>deals auto-created from <b>Cold Call</b> (on meeting_booked)</li><li>deal state updates from <b>Discovery Studio</b></li><li>pilot state from <b>Pilot Desk</b></li><li>advisor effect from <b>Call in a Favor</b></li></ul></div><div class="flowcol out"><div class="fh">Flows out</div><ul class="plain"><li>deal risk into <b>Future Autopsy</b> · <b>Dashboard</b> · <b>Readiness</b> · <b>sales handoff documentation</b></li><li>loss patterns into <b>Founding GTM</b></li></ul></div></div></div><div class="sec"><div class="sn">6 · Guardrails</div><h2>Must never be flattened · what it is NOT</h2><div class="two"><div><div class="sn" style="color:var(--red)">Must never be flattened</div><ul class="plain"><li>Deal risk</li><li>Next-step quality</li><li>Recorded stage supported by a concrete next step</li><li>Qualification seriousness</li></ul></div><div><div class="sn" style="color:var(--ink-3)">What it is NOT</div><ul class="plain"><li>Never a passive record page</li><li>Not a Kanban board</li><li>Not a pipeline CRM view</li><li>Not a stage-column drag surface</li></ul></div></div></div>
