 <div class="map"><h2>4. What this room is for and how it works</h2><p>The room's capability map: its purpose, every part and what it does, what flows in from and out to other rooms, and what it must never become.</p><div class="wrap">
-  <div class="mast"><div class="k">ICP Studio · Decision Bench · capability map</div><h1>The one sharp definition of who you sell to.</h1><div class="fam">Decision Bench (strategic shaping) · settled 2026-07-04</div><p>Sharpen the one definition of who you sell to so every downstream room can work against a real target. The ICP object is the thing being <b>sharpened</b> — it is the central authored surface, not a form output. Thin means fewer assumptions, fewer personas, fewer use cases. The ICP is the filter that manifests as “ICP Match” scoring on every Account, everywhere.</p><div class="src">Sourced from: canon §4.4 + the ICP build + 8-check quality engine (shipped src/icp-studio). Settled design: icp-studio-combo-flow-2026-07-04.html.</div></div>
-  <div class="sec"><div class="sn">1 · Purpose</div><h2>What the room is for</h2><div class="sd">Make one sharp ICP the filter the whole system runs against. The ICP is a <b>strategic bet</b> the operator authors, not a persona template they fill. Every account, everywhere, carries an ICP-Match score derived from this one definition.</div></div><div class="sec"><div class="sn">2 · What it offers</div><h2>Everything the room does</h2><table><tr><th style="width:230px">Capability / surface</th><th>What it does</th></tr><tr><td style="width:230px"><b>The ICP statement</b></td><td>The one authored definition — the central, sharpenable surface.</td></tr><tr><td style="width:230px"><b>The buying-group minimum</b></td><td>The smallest real buying group the motion needs.</td></tr><tr><td style="width:230px"><b>The focus recommendation</b></td><td>The system’s read of where to sharpen — narrower beats broader.</td></tr><tr><td style="width:230px"><b>The shaping inputs</b></td><td>owner · pain · trigger · the evidence window (time-to-convince) — the load-bearing fields.</td></tr><tr><td style="width:230px"><b>The match histogram</b></td><td>How the current account set scores against this ICP — the quality of the bet made visible.</td></tr><tr><td style="width:230px"><b>The 8-check quality engine</b></td><td>A 4-tier read on how sharp the ICP is (thinness rewarded, not penalized).</td></tr></table></div><div class="sec"><div class="sn">3 · Flows</div><h2>What comes in, what goes out</h2><div class="flows"><div class="flowcol inn"><div class="fh">Flows in</div><ul class="plain"><li>Onboarding activation (the interview-sharpened ICP)</li><li>founder conviction</li></ul></div><div class="flowcol out"><div class="fh">Flows out</div><ul class="plain"><li>ICP-Match score → <b>Territory Architect</b> · <b>Prospecting Desk</b> · <b>Signal Console</b> · <b>Outbound Studio</b> · <b>Discovery Studio</b> · <b>Readiness</b> · <b>Handoff Kit</b></li></ul></div></div></div><div class="sec"><div class="sn">4 · Guardrails</div><h2>Must never be flattened · what it is NOT</h2><div class="two"><div><div class="sn" style="color:var(--red)">Must never be flattened</div><ul class="plain"><li>ICP sharpness as a strategic bet</li><li>Never weaken it into a generic persona form</li><li>The ICP object is central and authored, not a form output</li></ul></div><div><div class="sn" style="color:var(--ink-3)">What it is NOT</div><ul class="plain"><li>Not a persona template</li><li>Not a worksheet</li><li>Not a demographics form</li><li>Not a “build your buyer” wizard</li></ul></div></div></div>
